📊 POWER BI BUSINESS INTELLIGENCE & SALES ANALYSIS
Project Overview

This project demonstrates the use of Microsoft Power BI for Business Intelligence and Data Analytics. The project uses a Superstore sales dataset to import, clean, model, analyze, visualize, and interpret business data.

The project covers the complete Power BI workflow:

Data Import → Data Cleaning → Data Modeling → DAX → Visualization → Interactive Dashboard → Business Insights

The dataset contains three tables:

Orders
People
Returns

The main analysis is performed using the Orders table, while People and Returns are used to demonstrate data modeling and relationships.

